# Stub pkg-config for wpe-webkit-1.1, standing in for the real WPEWebKit on the
# XiOne build host. It advertises ONLY the JavaScriptCore C API: the JSC C-API
# headers (sourced at fetch time from pinned Debian WebKitGTK debs by @jsc_deb
# and staged under include/JavaScriptCore) and the generated link stub
# (libWPEWebKit-1.1.so.0). This is what AAMP's CMakeLists.txt reads via
# pkg_check_modules(WPE_WEBKIT wpe-webkit-1.1) to obtain WPE_WEBKIT_INCLUDEDIR
# and WPE_WEBKIT_LINK_LIBRARIES for libaampjsbindings.so. At runtime the
# DT_NEEDED (libWPEWebKit-1.1.so.0) binds to the real library on the device.
#
# Paths are resolved relative to this file (${pcfiledir}) so it works wherever
# the jsc tree is staged. See README.md.
prefix=${pcfiledir}
includedir=${prefix}/include
libdir=${prefix}/lib

Name: WPE WebKit (JavaScriptCore C API stub)
Description: JSC C API headers + link stub for the XiOne AAMP jsbindings build
Version: 1.1.0
Cflags: -I${includedir}
Libs: -L${libdir} -lWPEWebKit-1.1
